; todo-v02-board.sabra — the v0.2 board summary (borg/dialect.borg v0.2).
;
; The 12.5 bridge folded the same board with numeric keys and rec-*
; calculus and answered [[1 <open>] [2 <done>]].  This is the retry on
; the shipped prelude: the fold is todo-open-count, the item accessor
; todo-entry, and the RESULT is a keyed literal.  The schema keys
; (key-open key-total) are ordinary defs defined beside the port - the
; reader knows no fields, the schema stays data.
;
;   {:open <open-count> :total <item-count>}
;
; Effects: tree/list over the granted prefix; math/add on the folds
; (F6: aggregates on the prim).

(lambda (prefix)
  (let ((items (prim "tree/list" prefix)))
    {:open (todo-open-count items)
     :total (list-fold (lambda (e) (lambda (acc) (prim "math/add" acc 1)))
                       0
                       items)}))
